{"image":"images/005c6d92ef37414ab5d41a5f0ad66656_qa_80aee0caa4e24a128f27c9cb9c306600.jpg","source_candidate":"positive/005c6d92ef37414ab5d41a5f0ad66656_qa_80aee0caa4e24a128f27c9cb9c306600.jpg","candidate":{"image":"positive/005c6d92ef37414ab5d41a5f0ad66656_qa_80aee0caa4e24a128f27c9cb9c306600.jpg","candidate_kind":"qa_recognized_question","needs_box_label":true,"sqlite":"D:\\AI\\kpai\\backend\\data\\accounts\\c92a0e4ea0244cd281d8224a72639c9d.sqlite3","image_id":"80aee0caa4e24a128f27c9cb9c306600","session_id":"005c6d92ef37414ab5d41a5f0ad66656","batch_id":"qa","qa_event_id":"5eb7ac3192e34c899eed75b9251245d0","question":"请讲解第4题：给出解题思路和最终答案。","answer_snippet":"题目：15. 妈妈用空气炸锅做了一些炸薯条。空气炸锅的内胆和扶手材质看上去十分不同（如右图），妈妈告诉慧慧（ ）。\nA. 材质不同主要是为了美观\nB. 内胆的材质是热的不良导体，防止薯条炸焦\nC. 扶手的材质是热的不良导体，防止烫伤\n\n学生答案：C\n\n检查结果：正确\n\n解题思路：\n1. 分析内胆：空气炸锅的内胆需要快速受热来炸熟食物，所以内胆材质通常是热的良导体，选项B说它是不良导体，错误。\n2. 分析扶手：扶手是手接触的地方，为了防止手被烫伤，材质必须是热的不良导体（隔热），选项C正确。\n3. 排除干扰：材质不同主要是为了安全和功能，不仅仅是为了美观，选项A错误。\n\n结论：C"},"width":3200,"height":1024,"boxes":[{"bbox_px":{"x":0,"y":0,"width":1022,"height":761},"score":0.74,"source":"layout_prelabel","quality_flags":["tall_block","near_full_page","page:bright_page"],"annotation_status":"draft_review_required"}],"metadata":{"page_rect_processing":{"x":0,"y":0,"width":447,"height":333,"source":"bright_page"},"processing_scale":0.4375,"line_box_count":11,"draft_box_count":1,"quarantine_reasons":[]},"active_learning":{"score":0.811,"reasons":["flag:near_full_page","flag:tall_block"],"source_manifest":"draft_boxes.jsonl"},"review_priority":20}
{"image":"images/1f54b22aed3942caa921fe075593a550_qa_7447eac1ed3741f8af63748d64c4ee87.jpg","source_candidate":"positive/1f54b22aed3942caa921fe075593a550_qa_7447eac1ed3741f8af63748d64c4ee87.jpg","candidate":{"image":"positive/1f54b22aed3942caa921fe075593a550_qa_7447eac1ed3741f8af63748d64c4ee87.jpg","candidate_kind":"qa_recognized_question","needs_box_label":true,"sqlite":"D:\\AI\\kpai\\backend\\data\\accounts\\c92a0e4ea0244cd281d8224a72639c9d.sqlite3","image_id":"7447eac1ed3741f8af63748d64c4ee87","session_id":"1f54b22aed3942caa921fe075593a550","batch_id":"qa","qa_event_id":"6243d97d8bb646138d211abc87a9f259","question":"请讲解第2题：给出解题思路和最终答案。","answer_snippet":"题13\n\n学生答案：B\n检查结果：正确\n\n解题思路：\n1. 辨析物质状态：我们看到的“白气”不是气态的水蒸气（水蒸气是肉眼看不见的），而是悬浮在空气中的小水珠，属于液态。\n2. 分析物态变化：锅里的热水产生大量高温水蒸气，冒出后遇到周围较冷的空气，放热液化成了小水珠，这就是“白气”。\n3. 排除干扰项：\n   - A错：白气是小水珠，不是水蒸气。\n   - C错：液化过程是放出热量，不是吸收。\n\n结论：选 B。"},"width":2958,"height":1290,"boxes":[{"bbox_px":{"x":2094,"y":245,"width":775,"height":539},"score":0.74,"source":"layout_prelabel","quality_flags":["tall_block","near_full_page","page:bright_page"],"annotation_status":"draft_review_required"}],"metadata":{"page_rect_processing":{"x":991,"y":116,"width":367,"height":255,"source":"bright_page"},"processing_scale":0.47329276538201487,"line_box_count":17,"draft_box_count":1,"quarantine_reasons":[]},"active_learning":{"score":0.811,"reasons":["flag:near_full_page","flag:tall_block"],"source_manifest":"draft_boxes.jsonl"},"review_priority":21}
{"image":"images/299631775fad422bbff9c20c17f84b9b_qa_a35c8ac7f7d54023a2920cd27419af2e.jpg","source_candidate":"positive/299631775fad422bbff9c20c17f84b9b_qa_a35c8ac7f7d54023a2920cd27419af2e.jpg","candidate":{"image":"positive/299631775fad422bbff9c20c17f84b9b_qa_a35c8ac7f7d54023a2920cd27419af2e.jpg","candidate_kind":"qa_recognized_question","needs_box_label":true,"sqlite":"D:\\AI\\kpai\\backend\\data\\accounts\\c92a0e4ea0244cd281d8224a72639c9d.sqlite3","image_id":"a35c8ac7f7d54023a2920cd27419af2e","session_id":"299631775fad422bbff9c20c17f84b9b","batch_id":"qa","qa_event_id":"e208eb138078482ab519524ce7dd6d2b","question":"看一下这道题","answer_snippet":"题3\n题目：下图梯形 ABCD 中，AD=7 厘米，BC=12 厘米，梯形高 8 厘米，求三角形 BOC 的面积比三角形 AOD 的面积大多少平方厘米？\n学生答案：9×999999=（疑似乱写或草稿）\n检查结果：未识别出有效解题过程。\n先想一想：\n1. 观察图形，三角形 ABC 和三角形 DBC 的底都是 BC，高都是梯形的高，所以它们的面积相等。\n2. 这两个大三角形都包含了一个公共部分——三角形 BOC。\n3. 如果两个相等的面积减去同一个公共部分，剩下的部分（三角形 AOD 和三角形 DOC）面积有什么关系？\n4. 换个思路：三角形 ABD 和三角形 ACD 面积相等，减去公共部分三角形 AOD，剩下的三角形 AOB 和三角形 DOC 面积相等。\n5. 题目问的是 BOC 比 AOD 大多少。我们可以利用“等积变形”：三角形 BOC 的面积 - 三角形 AOD 的面积 = (三角形 BOC + 三角形 AOB) - (三角形 AOD + 三角形 AOB) = 三角形 ABC - 三角形 ABD。\n6. 试着算出三角形 ABC 和三角形 ABD 的面积，看看它们的差是多少。\n下一步"},"width":1920,"height":1080,"boxes":[{"bbox_px":{"x":304,"y":0,"width":1289,"height":831},"score":0.74,"source":"layout_prelabel","quality_flags":["tall_block","near_full_page","page:bright_page"],"annotation_status":"draft_review_required"}],"metadata":{"page_rect_processing":{"x":35,"y":0,"width":1127,"height":606,"source":"bright_page"},"processing_scale":0.7291666666666666,"line_box_count":15,"draft_box_count":1,"quarantine_reasons":[]},"active_learning":{"score":0.811,"reasons":["flag:near_full_page","flag:tall_block"],"source_manifest":"draft_boxes.jsonl"},"review_priority":22}
